{
 "version": 1,
 "title": "Differentiate x² · sin x",
 "subject": "calculus",
 "language": "en-IN",
 "summary": "Use the product rule on x squared times sine x, simplify, and compare the graphs.",
 "actions": [
  {
   "do": "write_text",
   "id": "title",
   "text": "Find the derivative of  f(x) = x² · sin x",
   "x": 80,
   "y": 50,
   "size": 44,
   "color": "yellow",
   "say": "Let's find the derivative of x squared times sine x."
  },
  {
   "do": "write_math",
   "id": "f",
   "latex": "f(x) = x^2 \\sin x",
   "x": 80,
   "y": 140,
   "verified": true,
   "check": {
    "sympy": "x**2*sin(x)",
    "relation": "given",
    "variable": "x"
   },
   "say": "It's a product of two functions, so we use the product rule."
  },
  {
   "do": "write_math",
   "id": "rule",
   "latex": "(uv)' = u'v + uv'",
   "x": 860,
   "y": 140,
   "color": "blue",
   "say": "The derivative of u times v is u prime v plus u v prime."
  },
  {
   "do": "write_math",
   "id": "uv",
   "latex": "u = x^2, \\qquad v = \\sin x",
   "x": 80,
   "y": 230,
   "say": "Here u is x squared and v is sine x."
  },
  {
   "do": "write_math",
   "id": "duv",
   "latex": "u' = 2x, \\qquad v' = \\cos x",
   "x": 80,
   "y": 310,
   "verified": true,
   "check": {
    "sympy": "[(x**2, 2*x), (sin(x), cos(x))]",
    "relation": "derivatives",
    "variable": "x"
   },
   "say": "So u prime is two x, and v prime is cosine x."
  },
  {
   "do": "write_math",
   "id": "d1",
   "latex": "f'(x) = 2x\\sin x + x^2\\cos x",
   "x": 80,
   "y": 400,
   "step": "product rule",
   "verified": true,
   "check": {
    "sympy": "2*x*sin(x) + x**2*cos(x)",
    "relation": "derivative_of",
    "of": "f",
    "variable": "x"
   },
   "say": "Putting it together: f prime of x is two x sine x, plus x squared cosine x."
  },
  {
   "do": "highlight",
   "target": "d1",
   "color": "yellow",
   "say": "That's the answer."
  },
  {
   "do": "erase",
   "target": [
    "uv",
    "duv"
   ],
   "say": "We don't need the helper lines any more."
  },
  {
   "do": "write_math",
   "id": "d2",
   "latex": "f'(x) = x\\,(2\\sin x + x\\cos x)",
   "x": 80,
   "y": 490,
   "step": "factor out x",
   "color": "green",
   "verified": true,
   "check": {
    "sympy": "x*(2*sin(x) + x*cos(x))",
    "relation": "equal",
    "of": "d1",
    "variable": "x"
   },
   "say": "We can also factor out an x."
  },
